@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "TermsAndConditions";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}
<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/user/information.css" />

<div class="static-hero">
    <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
    <p>Last updated: April 2026</p>
</div>

<div class="static-body">
    <div class="policy-content">
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>1. Acceptance of Terms</h3>
            <p>By creating an account and using Reach.A.Paw, you agree to these terms and conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>2. User Accounts</h3>
            <p>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You must provide accurate information when registering. Reach.A.Paw reserves the right to suspend accounts that violate these terms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>3. Adoption Applications</h3>
            <p>Submitting an application does not guarantee adoption. Shelters have full discretion to approve or reject applications. All information provided in applications must be truthful and accurate.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>4. Payments</h3>
            <p>Adoption fees are set by individual shelters and are non-refundable once the adoption is marked as completed. Reach.A.Paw is not responsible for disputes between users and shelters regarding fees.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>5. Pet Welfare</h3>
            <p>By adopting a pet through Reach.A.Paw, you commit to providing proper care, nutrition, shelter, and veterinary attention. Neglect or abuse of adopted animals is a violation of these terms and may be reported to authorities.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>6. Community Forum</h3>
            <p>The community forum is for sharing pet-related stories, tips, and advice. Users must not post offensive, harmful, or misleading content. Reach.A.Paw reserves the right to remove posts that violate community guidelines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>7. Limitation of Liability</h3>
            <p>Reach.A.Paw is a platform connecting adopters with shelters. We are not liable for the actions of shelters or adopters, or for any disputes arising from adoptions conducted through the platform.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="policy-section">
            <h3>8. Changes to Terms</h3>
            <p>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Continued use of the platform after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>